      "title": "ICICI Prudential Asset Management Company Limited (NSEI:ICICIAMC) agreed to acquire 9.95% stake in IDFC First Bank Limited (BSE:539437).",
      "body": "ICICI Prudential Asset Management Company Limited (NSEI:ICICIAMC) agreed to acquire 9.95% stake in IDFC First Bank Limited (BSE:539437) on February 11, 2026.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval by regulatory board / committee. The RBI, while granting the above referred approval has also conveyed that if the Applicant fails to acquire major shareholding within a period of 1 (one) year from the date of aforesaid RBI letter, the approval shall stand cancelled.",
